{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id473799916"}, "name":{"label":"orion🦭"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-13T09:02:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"14178374217"}, "title":{"label":"Pricing changed and cannot purchase Pro Lifetime"}, "content":{"label":"I was using the annual pro, only for one year, and saved up for the lifetime for Pro. I'm extremely sad and upset seeing the lifetime rose so much in price. I can't afford it now and will unfortunately be moving to something else. I feel this is unfair... I genuinely enjoyed using Structured when I did, but it's unusable without Pro, for me at least, hence why I was planning on purchasing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id293155671"}, "name":{"label":"Lord_Banjo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-12T08:06:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"14174208355"}, "title":{"label":"Good but could use improvement."}, "content":{"label":"I am trying this app out, but find myself severely disappointed in how app handles “overlapping” tasks. I juggle 2 jobs with variable schedules, and have ADHD which this app claims to be aimed at, so I schedule out work shifts in my calendar so I visualize my week and plan other events around them. I want to be able to nest work tasks within that scheduled time, but with the way overlapping tasks are handled, it’s visually a mess. I would love to be able to have larger time blocks schedulable (or imported from calendar), with to dos ables to be placed inside them in a way that makes visual sense.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
