{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1281852653"}, "name":{"label":"Grace Aultman"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-03T11:49:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.0"}, "id":{"label":"14140147938"}, "title":{"label":"Solved My Time Management Struggles!"}, "content":{"label":"If you thrive on a schedule but need flexibility to fit your ever changing routine, this is the app for you! My plans are always changing, but I need routine and structure to survive, so I live off of this app. \n\nPros:\n- I use the free version and I only get the occasional pop up to try their paid version (I might get the pop up once or twice a day maybe).\n- It’s very simple to move plans around and make new ones.\n- It can connect to your health app and show you where you are in your cycle if you like to plan your day around that.\n- It even has an energy tracker option where you can see how much energy your tasks take and plan your day around how much energy you have. \n- I love that I can plan my day as simple or in-depth as I’d like.\n- Looks cute and is very customizable \n- I love that it’s compatible with my laptop and smart watch, so I always have an idea of how long my current task is and how long till my next task starts. \n\nCons:\n- literally none, this app is amazing!\n\n\nIf you need help with time management or making the most of your day, I 1,000% recommend this app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
